    <string name="tutorial_home_body">App iyi imagwira ntchito ndi chipangizo chapadera kuti iyeze kuchuluka kwa fluropure ndi kuona ngozi ya bowa m\'zitsanzo zanu.</string>
    <string name="tutorial_project_title">Sonkhanitsani chipangizo</string>
    <string name="tutorial_project_body">Sonkhanitsani chipangizo monga momwe zakuonetsedwera ndi kuyika foni pamwamba pake.</string>
    <string name="tutorial_step1_title">Kalibureshoni ya kutalika kwa mafunde</string>
    <string name="tutorial_step1_body">Ikani kiti ya kalibureshoni pa dzenje la chitsanzo ndi mbali ya kutalika kwa mafunde (kuwala kwa RGB) kutsogolo kwa foni. Kenako tengani zithunzi 1–5.</string>
    <string name="tutorial_step2_title">Kalibureshoni ya kuyankha kwa mafunde</string>
    <string name="tutorial_step2_body">Ikani kiti ya kalibureshoni pa dzenje la chitsanzo ndi mbali ya gwero (kuwala koyera) kutsogolo kwa foni. Kenako tengani zithunzi 1–5.</string>
    <string name="tutorial_step3_title">Kujambula chitsanzo</string>
    <string name="tutorial_step3_body">Ikani chitsanzo chanu kapena blank pa dzenje la chitsanzo ndi kutenga zithunzi 1–5.</string>
    <string name="tutorial_step4_title">Khoti la muyezo</string>
    <string name="tutorial_step4_body">Popanga khoti la muyezo, ikani chitsanzo chilichonse cha muyezo ndi blank yake pa dzenje la chitsanzo ndi kulemba kuchuluka kwake.</string>
